1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
An 800-year-old map still works here.
一张八百年的地图，今天照走

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Suzhou charted this lane in 1229.
苏州在1229年就画下了这条水巷

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Same rivers, same stone road, 800 years on.
河还是那条河，路还是那条路

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
Water on one side, stone lane on the other.
一边是水，一边是青石路

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
Fed by a branch of the Grand Canal.
水连着京杭大运河

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Teahouses still play Pingtan and Kunqu.
茶馆里仍在唱评弹昆曲

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Double-tap if you'd walk this water lane.
想走这条水巷，点个赞

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,800
Suzhou's water town, kept alive 800 years.
活了八百年的苏州水乡

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,000
★ Expert Tip: Come before 8am — silent lanes, teahouses just opening.
早上8点前来：水巷最静，茶馆刚开门

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Boat ride or walk the lane — which first?
坐船还是走巷子，你先选哪个
